---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="UMJC Membership - Kehilat Ohr HaTorah" pageTitle="UMJC Membership" pageIcon="fas fa-handshake" description="Kehilat Ohr HaTorah's membership in the Union of Messianic Jewish Congregations.">
    <section class="umjc-lead" aria-labelledby="umjc-lead-title">
        <p class="umjc-kicker"><i class="fas fa-handshake" aria-hidden="true"></i> Member congregation</p>
        <h2 id="umjc-lead-title"><strong>Kehilat Ohr HaTorah</strong> is a member of the Union of Messianic Jewish Congregations.</h2>
        <p>The most reliable way to understand the UMJC is through its own published vision and definition. Those primary statements are linked first below.</p>
        <div class="umjc-primary-links">
            <a href="https://www.umjc.org/vision" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Read the UMJC vision and beliefs <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.umjc.org/defining-messianic-judaism" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Read the UMJC definition <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="umjc-sections">
        <section class="umjc-section" aria-labelledby="about-umjc-title">
            <span class="umjc-section__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-synagogue"></i></span>
            <div>
                <p class="umjc-kicker">About the union</p>
                <h2 id="about-umjc-title">A shared Messianic Jewish framework</h2>
                <p>The UMJC's published vision centers Yeshua the Messiah, covenantal Jewish life, Torah, Jewish tradition, and the New Covenant. Its fuller statements address communal life, Jewish and non-Jewish participation, belief, and accountability.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="umjc-section" aria-labelledby="our-identity-title">
            <span class="umjc-section__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-scroll"></i></span>
            <div>
                <p class="umjc-kicker">Our congregation</p>
                <h2 id="our-identity-title">How that connects here</h2>
                <p>Our own approved identity statement and full congregational commitments are published separately so visitors can distinguish what Kehilat Ohr HaTorah affirms from material on an external site.</p>
                <a class="umjc-text-link" href="/mission">Read our vision, commitments, affirmations, and values <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="umjc-site-link" aria-label="UMJC website">
        <div>
            <p class="umjc-kicker">Continue at the source</p>
            <h2>Explore the UMJC</h2>
            <p>Visit the union's website for its history, congregations, leadership, and current resources.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.umjc.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Visit umjc.org <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
    </aside>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    .umjc-lead {
        padding: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 51, 91, 0.15);
        border-radius: 1rem 1rem 3rem 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75), rgba(237, 226, 196, 0.42));
        box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(6, 29, 53, 0.08);
    }

    .umjc-kicker {
        margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
        color: var(--gold-dark);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .umjc-kicker i {
        margin-right: 0.4rem;
    }

    .umjc-lead h2,
    .umjc-section h2,
    .umjc-site-link h2 {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .umjc-lead h2 {
        max-width: 25ch;
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem);
    }

    .umjc-lead > p:not(.umjc-kicker) {
        max-width: 70ch;
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .umjc-primary-links {
        display: inline-flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        margin-top: 1.4rem;
    }

    .umjc-primary-links a,
    .umjc-site-link > a {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.55rem;
        padding: 0.82rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        background: var(--primary-blue);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.3;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .umjc-primary-links a:hover,
    .umjc-primary-links a:focus-visible,
    .umjc-site-link > a:hover,
    .umjc-site-link > a:focus-visible {
        background: #004080;
    }

    .umjc-sections {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) 0;
    }

    .umjc-section {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 1.2rem;
        padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 51, 91, 0.12);
        border-radius: 0.8rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
    }

    .umjc-section__icon {
        display: inline-grid;
        width: 3rem;
        height: 3rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(177, 128, 24, 0.13);
        place-items: center;
        color: var(--gold-dark);
    }

    .umjc-section h2,
    .umjc-site-link h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    }

    .umjc-section p:not(.umjc-kicker),
    .umjc-site-link p:not(.umjc-kicker) {
        margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .umjc-text-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.45;
        text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
    }

    .umjc-site-link {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(7, 36, 66, 0.98), rgba(13, 51, 91, 0.94));
        color: #fff;
    }

    .umjc-site-link h2 {
        color: #fff;
    }

    .umjc-site-link p:not(.umjc-kicker) {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .umjc-site-link > a {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        background: var(--gold);
        color: var(--primary-blue);
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .umjc-primary-links,
        .umjc-primary-links a {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .umjc-section {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .umjc-site-link {
            align-items: stretch;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .umjc-site-link > a {
            width: 100%;
        }
    }
</style>
